Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:08.57,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Ta-Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.10,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:15.32,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't need to rush here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.90,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:21.95,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You sent an e-mail saying \Nthat you wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.00,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So, Nagase...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.31,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I did some thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:05.42,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,and I realized that I'm a selfish \Nand self-centered person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:07.74,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Once my mind is made up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:11.52,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I lock myself in and ignore all \Nother possible conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:14.94,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,And if I think I'm \Nright about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:18.65,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never admit that I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:22.12,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I ended up hurting \NInaba, arguing with Aoki,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.28,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,and hurt you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:27.03,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a selfish jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:30.00,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So I thought I should keep my distance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.63,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,to avoid hurting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.78,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But when I actually tried to \Ndistance myself, I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:37.99,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,that I want to be with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:40.45,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of staying away to \Navoid hurting everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:43.44,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather stay together and risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:49.64,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So, if you don't mind, \Ncan I stay by your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:56.45,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That's not fair, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:57.78,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Er, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:01.68,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I've been working hard to \Nkeep everyone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.85,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But everyone was getting hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:07.24,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so I figured it was inevitable \Nthat we'd fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.82,0:03:10.37,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I was convinced of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:13.11,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But now you say it doesn't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:15.20,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,if we all hurt each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.76,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:29.41,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But I never thought I'd hear you say
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:32.01,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,that it doesn't matter if \Nwe hurt each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I've been doing \Na lot of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.86,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to tell \Neveryone else what you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:41.95,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,just told me and bring \Nback the whole club?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:43.41,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.58,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,This doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:51.32,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I was trying hard, but then you \Njust took it all upon yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:53.00,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.97,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You're definitely a selfish jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:04:01.29,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But your head is usually \Nin the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.84,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Even if your methods aren't the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:06.62,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,My sister said something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:10.22,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I ended up injuring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:13.48,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you said it's inevitable \Nthat we'd hurt each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:15.60,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:18.44,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:20.32,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:23.06,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,First, I'll talk to Inaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:25.47,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll call Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:27.32,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, let's give it our best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.17,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.25,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:39.34,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.34,0:04:40.96,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So, Aoki...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:45.20,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I said some terrible things \Nto you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.97,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I was too arrogant and full of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I was convinced that I could \Ndo everything myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:53.21,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But that was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.78,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't undo the wrong I've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.10,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,but I want to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:57.77,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:01.90,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Aoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.65,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:06.09,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You beat me to the punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:07.85,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:09.83,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I was also going to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:10.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:15.41,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,When you called me, I knew \Nyou'd already beaten me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:19.82,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It really hurt when Iori-chan \Nsaid I was getting too jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:21.21,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I died a little on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.37,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm not saying that Iori-chan \Nwas being mean or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:26.30,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It hurt because she was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.92,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I was jealous of you because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:32.04,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you saved Yui and everyone \Nelse while I did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:35.18,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I started avoiding you guys because \Nit was hard for me to swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:37.34,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, I only saved them by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:40.39,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it was for my own reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:43.34,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,that I kept saying I \Nwanted to help Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:46.74,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:47.95,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Aoki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:53.28,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:56.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. No luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:59.17,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,She sent me packing before I \Nhad a chance to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:03.34,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm going to drop \Nby her house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:06.98,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably too soon for \Nus to tag along, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:15.44,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think Iori-chan got\N through to Inaba-chan this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.60,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'll call if it goes well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.52,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So since she hasn't called...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:22.90,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.79,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.37,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't it scream \Nadolescence when you see
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.01,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,two guys having a talk out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:32.53,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's enjoy our youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:37.50,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's possible to do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:39.37,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,something completely altruistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:43.98,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, in the end, everything \Nwe do is for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:45.83,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But I still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:48.13,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Want to help Yui, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:48.84,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:52.34,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't think we can do it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:55.01,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama has to let us help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:59.09,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, but we have no idea how \Nlong these episodes will continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.27,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,and she can't hide in her room forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.45,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,If Kiriyama has another episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:08.40,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,we should be able to stop \Nher if we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.28,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You think we can stop Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:15.16,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,If we're really careful \Nand try our best...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:18.26,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's an old-fashioned \Nway of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.59,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:23.14,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,how you were able to cure Yui's trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:25.99,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I took your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:26.46,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.74,0:07:29.95,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You mentioned that \Nswapping personalities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:31.88,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,presented us with new opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:34.24,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's how I got the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.46,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So maybe there's a solution
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:39.32,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,that's unique to \Nour current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.98,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I-I think I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:50.24,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.42,CRKokoro,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yui? Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.80,CRKokoro,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Your friends are here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.54,CRKokoro,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Open the door, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:01.74,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, "Mom"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.21,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,We'll talk to Yui-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.84,CRKokoro,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for dropping by so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.14,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Please, I would do \Nanything for Yui-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:15.30,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui, it's me and Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:18.57,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,We want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:19.68,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Can you open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:21.79,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:30.15,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:31.23,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:34.91,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui, let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:36.15,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:37.40,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:39.03,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do I \Nhave to repeat myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:42.75,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know when I might \Nsuddenly beat someone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.62,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I can't step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:47.05,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But if you just hide in here forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.80,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,this whole mess might never get fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.25,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:57.21,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You can stop yourself \Nfrom beating someone up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:58.43,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:08:59.84,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I can try to stop myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.72,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,but if I have an episode, \NI'll lose control!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.12,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:05.73,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Even when your desire is unleashed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:10.69,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,if you try really, really hard \Nto stop yourself, it'll work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:14.47,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,It won't work when your \Ndesire is unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:17.02,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You can't stop yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.32,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:21.38,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's how it works, but \Nit's not how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:22.08,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:25.33,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying that you can stop yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.35,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,If I can prove that it's possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:28.70,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,you'll be able to come outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:29.87,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,come to school,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:31.67,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,and come to the clubroom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:35.71,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if I can stop myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:37.45,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, that's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.12,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say I'm proud of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:42.04,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,but I love you, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.89,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I really love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.14,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I love you so much! So, so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:48.49,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm also not proud to admit \Nthat I have a dirty mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.92,0:09:50.50,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,To be frank, my mind is \Nalways in the gutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:51.36,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking dirty thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.90,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Really dirty thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:54.72,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, what are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:58.09,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,And honestly, if I had \Nan episode right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:10:01.87,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I would be seconds away from \Nthrowing myself on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:04.94,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:05.95,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,That's despicable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.95,0:10:07.89,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:07.89,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Sicko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:09.35,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying that my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:13.48,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,ironclad determination will \Nstop me from doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:15.26,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It proves that, if you're \Ndetermined enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.72,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you can fight back when your \Ndesire is unleashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.51,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,H-How stupid can you be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.51,0:10:21.31,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea what \Nyou're trying to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:25.22,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I understand \Nwhat you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.42,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.38,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,So, Yui...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.52,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's spend a night in a love hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.75,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:38.02,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Why would I put myself in danger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:39.50,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Because nothing will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.28,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,How can you be so sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:45.79,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Because the last thing I \Nwant to do is hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:51.46,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Because I truly love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:54.69,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm confident that my \Ndesire to not hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.75,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,will always be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.18,0:11:02.14,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, on the off chance \Nthat I do give in,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.56,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,you would have no trouble \Nbeating me to a pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:08.18,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:11.90,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, you should wear \Nsomething sexy to tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:14.10,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Strip down to your underwear,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.72,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,dress up like a bunny girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:16.94,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,or wear nothing but an apron...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:19.65,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Stop fantasizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:22.03,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.69,0:11:24.00,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:25.61,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Seal the deal with \Nthat gibberish of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:27.79,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call it gibberish before \NI even say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:31.79,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:34.57,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,So let's hear your gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:36.83,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't join in, Kiriyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.41,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Had you ever injured someone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:47.28,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,or gotten violent before what \Nhappened at the train station?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:51.16,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I practice karate, so \Nit's happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:55.72,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,But it didn't feel like I was \Nusing violence to hurt someone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:58.69,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,since it was during a match or practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:00.48,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:01.98,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's why you didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:05.52,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,understand what it \Nmeant to hurt someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:06.95,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:07.86,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:11.66,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But now you understand how hard it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:15.33,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,And you don't want to hurt anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.67,0:12:18.91,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Which means if you ever \Nwant to beat someone up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:22.59,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,your desire to not hurt anyone \Nwill probably triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:27.60,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you could consider not \Nwanting to do something a desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:30.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I hurt Nagase
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.56,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,the other day when I had an episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:33.23,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:36.91,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So I think I kinda understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:40.35,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But I still want to be with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:42.11,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm guessing that you feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:45.72,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You should believe in yourself more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.62,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Good job, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:52.05,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,But you just made a\N bunch of assumptions
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:53.87,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,with no concrete proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:55.71,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,So let's go to a love hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:57.65,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Stop talking about \Ngoing to a love hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:59.17,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Mama's downstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:02.54,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama, your voice is too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:06.37,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:07.34,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:08.72,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:08.72,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:10.55,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,To school!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.15,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm still worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:15.69,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:21.06,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,If it looks like I'm losing control,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:23.96,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,please stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:29.03,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the way to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:29.55,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.33,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Say this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.08,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Please protect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.04,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It would be my honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.68,CRKokoro,Bro,0000,0000,0000,,Himeko?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:08.51,CRKokoro,Bro,0000,0000,0000,,Did your phone just ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:12.95,CRKokoro,Bro,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:15.31,CRKokoro,Bro,0000,0000,0000,,You've been acting strangely again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.28,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You're imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.05,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:24.93,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:28.13,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait, Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:29.32,CRKokoro,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.80,CRKokoro,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,You came to school, Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:33.64,CRKokoro,Kai,0000,0000,0000,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:36.86,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. Were you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:40.19,CRKokoro,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Of course we were. Silly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.47,CRKokoro,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,We spent every day agonizing over
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:44.57,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,whether we should visit you or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:47.23,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.23,CRKokoro,Goto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kiriyama. You're back at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.30,CRKokoro,Goto,0000,0000,0000,,You look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:55.08,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sorry about making everyone worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.83,CRKokoro,Goto,0000,0000,0000,,Did you put on some weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.11,0:14:59.85,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You're imagining things!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:02.52,CRKokoro,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:04.75,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Hey! Watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:07.42,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I hope Inaban also \Ncomes to the clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:12.14,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,So much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:14.87,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't this a little excessive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.67,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I was only going to buy \Nenough for this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.62,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,but I had an episode at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:23.65,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I used up my allowance for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:26.66,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It's too late to return them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:28.82,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Aoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:30.35,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Aoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:33.53,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Give me that mitarashi dango!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.74,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Desire unleashed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:35.24,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.77,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Don't take mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:39.67,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Give me the mitarashi dango!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.91,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I wondered where this would lead...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:42.46,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}There's more over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:46.03,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,No! I absolutely must have yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:48.01,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you want mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:49.92,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.52,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, Nagase!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:52.82,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I already took a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:53.93,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Grab another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:56.02,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I want the sandwich in your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:57.40,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,These are all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:58.87,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Kiriyama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.39,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:05.11,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Three at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:09.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if it's just their hunger \Nthat's being released,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:11.24,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,that's not bad—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.11,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Eat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.03,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Give me some!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:21.34,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:26.79,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Um, if you're worried about what you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:29.46,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,said to me the other day,\N I've gotten over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.74,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Come back to the clubroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:35.36,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,We're all waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:36.35,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:49.91,CRKokoro,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Himeko, you have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:51.49,CRKokoro,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's Mr. Goto, your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.13,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Goto?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:10.30,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You're not here to tell me \Nthat it's over, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:14.44,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:18.00,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Were you surfing the web?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:19.35,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:24.60,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Back in middle school, \Nthat's all you ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:28.55,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You spent all your time \Noutside class alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:30.61,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You couldn't trust anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.02,0:17:33.46,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You always put up barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:38.45,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You were socially active enough that \Nyou'd have no problems at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.33,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,but you had no friends—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:42.39,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:47.15,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not interested in any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If you need something, spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.68,0:17:53.09,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Have you forgotten, Inaba-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:59.68,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I told you that I would make \Nit entertaining if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:02.86,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Are you gonna toss me \Nin the river this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:06.06,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I thought that only applied \Nif we hid in our rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:11.57,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba-san, you're essentially \Nhiding in your room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:16.64,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true. I'm going to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:20.22,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,To prevent me from interfering?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.70,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You're a fascinating person, Inaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.60,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Can you get to the point?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.83,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't come here to make small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:29.99,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Small talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:33.28,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:38.22,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to shake things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Shake things up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:41.82,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:44.77,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You're so uptight, Inaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:48.19,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so uptight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:50.15,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Because you decided to mess
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:52.23,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,with us by unleashing our desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:55.37,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:58.42,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you care so \Nmuch about preserving
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.11,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,that atmosphere you \Nshare with your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:05.37,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,If it's wearing you out, \Nyou should tear it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:10.01,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Judging from your \Ncurrent state of mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:13.61,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,if your little group falls apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:16.84,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,you'll try to destroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:21.46,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,At least, that's what I was hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:25.27,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:29.78,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Is the atmosphere you \Nshared what you care
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.40,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,about the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.42,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:38.11,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there something else \Nyou care about just as much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:42.24,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:44.79,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, there most certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:49.16,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,But you're trying desperately \Nto pretend you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.93,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Because you'll destroy your little group
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:54.67,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,if you let those feelings out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.84,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there someone \Nyou care for deeply?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.70,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:07.05,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You've become fully aware \Nof your own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:09.98,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,There's no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:15.19,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Once you know, it's \Ntoo late to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:18.07,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:22.37,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't expect this to work so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:26.20,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:31.21,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Can I sock you real hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.51,0:20:33.97,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I'll return control to this body's owner
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:36.48,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,the moment before you hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:40.37,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to visit anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.73,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:46.85,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I made this trip just to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:51.23,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you find these \Nlittle twists entertaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.17,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:55.80,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,And if you're able to \Ntake control of anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:59.11,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,why did you use Goto instead \Nof a family member?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:03.68,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,There are very few people who \Nwouldn't start asking questions when
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:06.00,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,they have blanks in their memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:10.74,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Stop trying to hide in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.23,0:21:25.30,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:26.56,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.88,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:30.43,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,We were wondering why you were late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:32.69,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't gonna skip out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:35.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,since I was responsible \Nfor bringing the veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:37.07,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:39.82,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If we're late, Fujishima \Nwill start griping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:59.92,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It feels like it's been ages since \Nwe just chatted about nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.87,0:22:00.96,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Are the three of them doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:04.05,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,That's the only way the five \Nof us can stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.70,0:22:05.01,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What's that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.01,0:22:06.14,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:07.01,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:08.77,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She knows! She knows!
